---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About Iowa CYP | Serving Guard Families Statewide
description: Learn about the Iowa Child & Youth Program mission, vision, strategic priorities, and the team supporting National Guard families with year-round programming.
permalink: /about/index.html
---
<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0" data-video-shell>
    <img src="/assets/img/about/about_teaching.jpg" alt="" class="video-poster" aria-hidden="true" {{ imageAttrs('/assets/img/about/about_teaching.jpg') }} decoding="async">
    <video
      class="video-fade h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_35%] brightness-75 saturate-90 contrast-110"
      autoplay
      loop
      muted
      playsinline
      preload="metadata"
      data-video-fade
      data-video-lazy
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <source src="/content/media/about.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
    <noscript>
      <img
        src="/assets/img/about/about_teaching.jpg"
        alt="Iowa CYP team member leading a hands-on lesson with youth"
        class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
        {{ imageAttrs('/assets/img/about/about_teaching.jpg') }}
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      >
    </noscript>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950/94 via-slate-950/82 to-slate-950/60"></div>
  <div class="relative container min-h-[70vh] py-24 flex items-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/88 p-6 md:p-10 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md space-y-6 text-white" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-secondary">ABOUT IOWA CYP</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-white">ABOUT THE IOWA CHILD &amp; YOUTH PROGRAM</h1>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-white/95 leading-relaxed">Iowa CYP supports Guard families by strengthening youth and reducing the everyday pressures of military life. Through programs, events, and resources, we build connection, resilience, and readiness across Iowa.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a class="hero-cta" href="/support/#community-partners">Partner With Us</a>
        <a class="hero-cta-secondary" href="{{ site.links.eventsSubscribe }}">Stay in the Loop</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="mission" class="bg-white py-16" data-reveal>
  <div class="container space-y-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-primary/80">WHO WE ARE</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-900">BUILT FOR GUARD FAMILIES&mdash;FROM DRILL WEEKEND TO HOMECOMING</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-800 text-lg leading-relaxed">For more than two decades, we&rsquo;ve invested in Guard-connected youth through trusted mentors, resilient friendships, and experiences that reinforce stability at home.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="content-card content-card--outline-gold space-y-4" data-interactive="true">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-secondary">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-7 w-7">
            <rect x="5" y="3" width="2" height="18" rx="1" fill="currentColor"></rect>
            <rect x="7.5" y="4" width="9" height="5.5" rx="1.2" fill="currentColor"></rect>
            <rect x="7.5" y="10.5" width="9" height="5.5" rx="1.2" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7"></rect>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="content-card__title text-slate-800">Our Mission</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">{{ info.mission }}</p>
      </article>
      <article class="content-card content-card--outline-gold space-y-4" data-interactive="true">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-secondary">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-7 w-7">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.15"></circle>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></circle>
            <path d="M12 8.5l2.4 4-4.8 2.2L12 8.5Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="white"></circle>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="content-card__title text-slate-800">Our Vision</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">{{ info.vision }}</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="strategic" class="bg-primary/5 py-20" data-reveal>
  <div class="container space-y-12">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-primary/70">How We Work</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-[0.1em]">The foundation behind every event, resource, and connection</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-800">Behind the scenes, we focus on a set of core priorities that ensure programs run smoothly, resources reach families, and leaders across the state see measurable impact.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      {% for pillar in info.strategicInfrastructure %}
        <article class="content-card space-y-2" data-interactive="true" data-reveal>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            {% if loop.index == 1 %}
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-7 w-7 text-slate-700">
                <circle cx="8" cy="12" r="3.2" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.85"></circle>
                <circle cx="16" cy="12" r="3.2" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.55"></circle>
                <path d="M10.2 13.5 14.5 15.8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                <path d="M14.5 15.8v-2.8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
              </svg>
            {% elseif loop.index == 2 %}
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-7 w-7 text-slate-700">
                <path d="M7 16a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-1a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h1.6l7.4-3.7A1 1 0 0 1 18 6.2v11.6a1 1 0 0 1-1.9.5L8.6 14H7Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                <path d="M8.5 14.5 10 17.4A2 2 0 0 0 11.8 18.5H14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
              </svg>
            {% elseif loop.index == 3 %}
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-7 w-7 text-slate-700">
                <rect x="4" y="13" width="4" height="7" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6"></rect>
                <rect x="10" y="9" width="4" height="11" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8"></rect>
                <rect x="16" y="5" width="4" height="15" rx="1" fill="currentColor"></rect>
                <path d="M4 21h16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
              </svg>
            {% else %}
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-7 w-7 text-slate-700">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.15"></circle>
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle>
                <path d="M12 4a12 12 0 0 1 0 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                <path d="M7 12h10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
              </svg>
            {% endif %}
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">{{ pillar.title }}</h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">{{ pillar.description }}</p>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="values" class="bg-white py-20" data-reveal>
  <div class="container space-y-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-primary/80">Core Values</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">How we show up for Guard families every day.</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-800">These values guide how we plan, partner, and deliver—whether we’re in a school gym, on the road, or huddled with parents over coffee.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
      {% for value in info.coreValues %}
        <div class="content-card-shell">
          <article class="content-card content-card--shell-inner h-full flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4" data-interactive="true" data-reveal>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
              {% set iconClasses = 'h-10 w-10 text-slate-700' %}
              {% if value.icon == 'show-up' %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="{{ iconClasses }}">
                  <path d="M12 3 19 6v5.2c0 4.4-2.8 8-7 10-4.2-2-7-5.6-7-10V6Z" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.9"></path>
                  <path d="M9.2 12.1 11.1 14l3.8-4" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                </svg>
              {% elseif value.icon == 'build-connection' %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="{{ iconClasses }}">
                  <circle cx="7" cy="8" r="2.2" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.9"></circle>
                  <circle cx="17" cy="8" r="2.2" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.9"></circle>
                  <circle cx="12" cy="16" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"></circle>
                  <path d="M8.7 9.2 10.8 13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                  <path d="M15.3 9.2 13.2 13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                </svg>
              {% elseif value.icon == 'be-intentional' %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="{{ iconClasses }}">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></circle>
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2" fill="currentColor"></circle>
                  <path d="M12 4.5v2.2M12 17.3v2.2M4.5 12h2.2M17.3 12h2.2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                </svg>
              {% elseif value.icon == 'earn-trust' %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="{{ iconClasses }}">
                  <path d="M4.8 12.2 8.5 8.5c.5-.5 1.3-.5 1.8 0l.8.8.8-.8c.5-.5 1.3-.5 1.8 0l1.2 1.2 1-.9c.5-.5 1.3-.5 1.8 0l2 2c.5.5.5 1.3 0 1.8l-1.1 1.1c-1.7 1.7-3.5 2.5-5.5 2.5H11l-2.3 2.3c-.5.5-1.3.5-1.8 0l-2.1-2.1c-.5-.5-.5-1.3 0-1.8Z" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.9"></path>
                  <path d="M14.2 11.8 15.9 13.5" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                </svg>
              {% elseif value.icon == 'keep-growing' %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="{{ iconClasses }}">
                  <path d="M12 19.5V10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                  <path d="M12 10c0-3.2 2.3-5.8 5.5-6.3-.1 3.2-2.8 5.9-5.5 6.3Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                  <path d="M12 12.2c-2.8 0-5.1-2.1-5.5-4.9 2.8.1 5.4 2.1 5.5 4.9Z" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7"></path>
                  <path d="M7 20h10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                </svg>
              {% else %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="{{ iconClasses }}">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.15"></circle>
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle>
                  <path d="M12 5v14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                  <path d="M8 9.5 12 5l4 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                </svg>
              {% endif %}
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">{{ value.title }}</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">{{ value.description }}</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="team" class="relative isolate overflow-hidden py-24" data-reveal>
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <img
      src="/assets/img/team/fun.jpg"
      alt="Iowa CYP team collaborating at Camp Dodge"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
      {{ imageAttrs('/assets/img/team/fun.jpg') }}
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    >
  </div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/75"></div>
  <div class="container relative space-y-12 text-white">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:items-start">
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-white/80">Meet the Team</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-white">Program staff who plan shoulder-to-shoulder with Iowa Guard families.</h2>
      <p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed">Our staff includes coordinators, coaches, and camp leads who grew up in military households or have served alongside them. We stay on the road, on the phone, and online so every family has a direct line to someone who understands the rhythm of Guard life.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="bg-white/10 border border-white/25 rounded-[2rem] p-6 backdrop-blur">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-4">Reach the CYP Office</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-white/85">
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Office:</span> {{ team.officeLocation }}</li>
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Main Phone:</span> <a class="text-secondary hover:text-white transition" href="tel:{{ site.contactPhone | replace(' ', '') }}">{{ site.contactPhone }}</a></li>
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Inbox:</span> <a class="text-secondary hover:text-white transition" href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      {% for member in team.members %}
        <article class="content-card bg-white/95 border-white/60 shadow-lg space-y-6" data-reveal>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            {% if member.headshot %}
              <img src="{{ member.headshot }}" alt="{{ member.name }}" class="h-24 w-24 rounded-full object-cover border border-slate-200" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            {% endif %}
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">{{ member.name }}</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-primary font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">{{ member.title }}</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">{{ member.organization }}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">{{ member.bio }}</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-1">
            <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:{{ member.email }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M20 4H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12c0 1.103.897 2 2 2h16c1.103 0 2-.897 2-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2zm0 2v.01L12 13 4 6.01V6h16zM4 18v-9.764l7.382 5.768a1 1 0 001.236 0L20 8.236V18H4z"/>
              </svg>
              <span>{{ member.email }}</span>
            </a>
            <a class="contact-link" href="tel:{{ member.phone | replace('-', '') }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M16.487 15.56l-2.675-.305a1 1 0 00-.85.287l-1.02 1.046a11.055 11.055 0 01-4.53-4.53l1.046-1.02a1 1 0 00.287-.85l-.305-2.675A1.5 1.5 0 007.96 6H5.5A1.5 1.5 0 004 7.5C4 15.032 9.968 21 17.5 21a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.5V17.04a1.5 1.5 0 00-1.013-1.48z"/>
              </svg>
              <span>{{ member.phone }}</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          {% if member.social %}
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-2">
              {% for social in member.social %}
                <a class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:underline" href="{{ social.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ social.label }}</a>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-white py-20" data-reveal>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content-card md:flex md:items-center md:justify-between md:gap-10" data-interactive="true">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-primary/80">Stay Connected</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Get the Iowa National Guard mobile app.</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Turn on push alerts for new CYP events, quick access to resources, and reminders that keep your family synced with Guard updates.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center pt-6 md:pt-0">
        {% if site.links.appStore %}
          <a class="app-badge" href="{{ site.links.appStore }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <img src="/assets/img/badges/app-store-badge.svg" alt="Download on the App Store" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="180" height="60">
          </a>
        {% endif %}
        {% if site.links.googlePlay %}
          <a class="app-badge" href="{{ site.links.googlePlay }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <img src="/assets/img/badges/google-play-badge.svg" alt="Get it on Google Play" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="180" height="60">
          </a>
        {% endif %}
        {% if not site.links.appStore and not site.links.googlePlay %}
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Mobile app download links coming soon. <a class="text-primary" href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}?subject=IANG%20App%20Updates">Email us to be notified.</a></p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
